# Agent and editor state. These record local paths, machine-specific
# workflow notes, and permission grants — none of which belong in a public
# repository, and all of which are easy to commit by accident.
# The private companion repo (tunnelbar-build) is cloned to .private/, and
# CLAUDE.md and .claude/skills are symlinks into it.
/.private/
/CLAUDE.md
/CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/
